        "ee292b11a73e00ea3f5d1e2ee25cf9579f6c7532"
      ],
      "title": "Q.933: Fix decoding of PVC Status field",
      "message": "Q.933: Fix decoding of PVC Status field\n\nThis field is actually a bitmask of four bits.  It's somewhat odd\nto decode it using a value_string.  In any case, the values were\nplain wrong (shifted to the left by '1').\n\nSee Figure A.3 of ITU-T Q.933\n\nA related pcap file can be found at\nhttps://people.osmocom.org/laforge/pcap/gsmtap-fr-q933-pvc_status.pcap\n",
      "author_name": "Harald Welte",
      "author_email": "laforge@osmocom.org",
      "authored_date": "2020-09-11T22:14:05.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Harald Welte",
      "committer_email": "laforge@osmocom.org",
      "committed_date": "2020-09-11T23:42:00.000+02:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/13ac47ad4ecdf9ce4363d89f15a245fc10c3c67e"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee292b11a73e00ea3f5d1e2ee25cf9579f6c7532",
      "short_id": "ee292b11",
      "created_at": "2020-09-11T22:40:33.000+02:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "726e0ccb0a1c491693ee73c0f29ff3a7fd73d301"
      ],
      "title": "Q,933: Fix display of 'active' bit in PVC Status",
      "message": "Q,933: Fix display of 'active' bit in PVC Status\n\nThe mask applied to the final octet of the PVC Status IE must be 0x0E,\nnot 0x0A.  The current code masks out the active bit, printing a '.'\ninstead of it.\n\nSee Figure A.3 of ITU-T Q.933\n\nA related pcap file can be found at\nhttps://people.osmocom.org/laforge/pcap/gsmtap-fr-q933-pvc_status.pcapc\n",
      "author_name": "Harald Welte",
      "author_email": "laforge@osmocom.org",
      "authored_date": "2020-09-11T22:05:54.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Harald Welte",
      "committer_email": "laforge@osmocom.org",
      "committed_date": "2020-09-11T22:40:33.000+02:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/ee292b11a73e00ea3f5d1e2ee25cf9579f6c7532"
    }
  ],
